#. ~ Description of ".40 S&W ammo box"
#: data/json/items/containers/ammo_boxes.json
msgid ""
"This box holds 20 rounds of .40 S&W ammo.  It's made of a thin cardboard "
"plastered with text about the ammo, and the manufacturer's logo."
msgstr ""
"To pudełko mieści 20 naboi .40 S&W. Jest zrobione z cienkiej tektury pokrytej"
" opisem amunicji i logo producenta."

#. ~ Description of variant "84mm HE crate" of item "84mm HE crate"
#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
msgid ""
"A big metal crate.  On one side it has label \"EXPLOSIVE\", and on another is written:\n"
